Package: mimic
Title: Synthetic Data and Output Control for Small Populations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Minik", , "danielminik@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Supports remote execution on register data about small
    populations. Describe a dataset with disclosure protection applied
    before anything is stored, build a synthetic copy from that
    description, test a researcher's script on the copy, run it on the real
    data in an isolated session with a safe error report, and check the
    output before release. Defaults are stricter than in tools designed for
    large countries.
